  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"737\" class=\"elementor elementor-737\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-292bb3fc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"60002\" data-id=\"292bb3fc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1171b186 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1171b186\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Marie Drake, Attorney, and Founder of The Drake Law Firm PC, a full-service law firm based in Golden, Colorado that focuses on family law, business law, and real estate, announces the firm&#8217;s sponsorship of a hole in a charity golf tournament on October 9, 2021. The event will raise money for Living Journeys, a 501(c)(3) organization that provides financial grants, emotional support, and enrichment programs to cancer-affected Gunnison County residents.</p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-3134 size-large\" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/the_drake_law_firm_pc_to_sponsor_living_journeys_golf_tournament-1024x686.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"686\" srcset=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/the_drake_law_firm_pc_to_sponsor_living_journeys_golf_tournament-1024x686.jpg 1024w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/the_drake_law_firm_pc_to_sponsor_living_journeys_golf_tournament-300x201.jpg 300w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/the_drake_law_firm_pc_to_sponsor_living_journeys_golf_tournament-768x514.jpg 768w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/the_drake_law_firm_pc_to_sponsor_living_journeys_golf_tournament.jpg 1178w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></p><p>Living Journeys “envisions a community where all people who have a relationship with cancer feel supported and enjoy a sense of wellbeing to the largest extent possible.” To realize their vision, Living Journeys offers free support groups facilitated by licensed, professional therapists; offers cash grants, private therapy grants, and transportation assistance; and provides homemade meals for “our friends and neighbors battling cancer.”</p><p>For Drake, a five-year survivor of a rare type of breast cancer, it is a cause close to her heart. “Cancer killed my mother at age 53 in 1987, and I am so grateful to have survived the same cancer,” she explains. “Living Journeys supports people battling cancer in Gunnison County, where I grew up. I&#8217;m so grateful for their advocacy and outreach to community members during perhaps the most vulnerable times of their lives. It&#8217;s an honor to help Living Journeys continue their excellent work so that no one in Gunnison County has to fight a cancer diagnosis alone.”</p><p>The event will be held at the Dos Rios Golf Course in Gunnison, Colorado  on Saturday, October 9, 2021. For more information, visit <a id=\"insertion_315226\" class=\"insertion link\" href=\"https://dosriosgolf.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-insertion-id=\"315226\">https://dosriosgolf.net/</a> or call <a href=\"tel:303-261-8111\">(303) 261-8111</a>.</p><h2>About Living Journeys</h2><p>Living Journeys provides financial grants, emotional support, and enrichment programs to Gunnison County residents affected by cancer. We envision a community where all people who have a relationship with cancer feel supported and enjoy a sense of wellbeing to the largest extent possible. </p><h2>About The Drake Law Firm, P.C.</h2><p>The Drake Law Firm, PC. is a full-service law firm that focuses on family law, business law, and real estate. While some disputes require litigation, we are also successful at achieving our clients&#8217; goals prior to trial through settlement. At the Drake Law Firm, P.C., we believe in listening to our clients and helping them meet their goals. We proudly serve Colorado and the Rocky Mountain region.</p><h2>Distribution Links</h2><ul><li><a id=\"insertion_316241\" class=\"insertion link\" href=\"https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572736\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-insertion-id=\"316241\">https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572736</a></li><li><a id=\"insertion_316242\" class=\"insertion link\" href=\"https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572457\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-insertion-id=\"316242\">https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572457</a></li><li><a id=\"insertion_316243\" class=\"insertion link\" href=\"https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572440\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-insertion-id=\"316243\">https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572440</a></li><li><a id=\"insertion_316255\" class=\"insertion link\" href=\"https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572748\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-insertion-id=\"316255\">https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572748</a></li><li><a id=\"insertion_316256\" class=\"insertion link\" href=\"https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572443\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-insertion-id=\"316256\">https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572443</a></li><li><a id=\"insertion_316257\" class=\"insertion link\" href=\"https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572427\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-insertion-id=\"316257\">https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572427</a></li><li><a id=\"insertion_316259\" class=\"insertion link\" href=\"https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572750\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-insertion-id=\"316259\">https://app.quantumnewswire.com/redir/94597/572750</a></li><li><a id=\"insertion_316258\" class=\"inse